Retained tool evaluations
=========================

These task prompts assess whether an agent selects and reads the retained tools
correctly. They complement executable tests and do not establish runtime
acceptance. Retained cases cover load/unload, session/theory discovery and
theory-name substring search. check_theory is retired (2026-09-12): it was
identical to load_theory, and its edit-verify-loop signal now lives in
evals/load_theory. Documentation and user-declared ML tool behavior
can be evaluated with small fixtures using the same prompt/success format.

Do not require retired interfaces in a surviving evaluation. Report tool output
faithfully, especially positioned diagnostics and unavailable documentation.
